{"name":"骨架屏","description":"页面加载时先出现的灰色轮廓，用来占住稍后内容的位置 · 例如打开商品列表时，可先看到图片框和两行文字的轮廓，真实内容到达后再替换。它只表示正在加载；等待过久或加载失败时，必须改成明确的提示和重试入口。","quote":"加载时先显示灰色的框框占位，别一直转圈。","agentPrompt":"文章列表等待数据时，请显示接近真实图片和标题布局的骨架，数据到达后原位替换；请求失败时改成错误和重试，不要一直保留骨架。请确认内容出现时页面没有明显跳动。","html":"<div class=\"detail-body detail-entry-skeleton\"><section class=\"detail-hero\" id=\"detail-hero\"><div class=\"dh-head\"><h1>骨架屏<span>Skeleton</span></h1></div><div class=\"dh-quote\"><span class=\"dh-quote-label\">你可能会说</span><p class=\"dh-quote-text\">加载时先显示灰色的框框占位，别一直转圈。</p></div><div class=\"dh-tagline\"><strong class=\"dh-summary-lead\">页面加载时先出现的灰色轮廓，用来占住稍后内容的位置</strong><span class=\"dh-summary-separator\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><span>例如打开商品列表时，可先看到图片框和两行文字的轮廓，真实内容到达后再替换。它只表示正在加载；等待过久或加载失败时，必须改成明确的提示和重试入口。</span></div><div class=\"dh-demo\"><div class=\"dh-demo-viewport\"><div class=\"dh-demo-inner\"><div class=\"skeleton-demo\"><div class=\"skeleton-row\"><i class=\"skeleton-avatar\"></i><div class=\"skeleton-lines\"><i class=\"skeleton-line\" style=\"width:60%\"></i><i class=\"skeleton-line\" style=\"width:85%\"></i></div></div><div class=\"skeleton-row\"><i class=\"skeleton-avatar\"></i><div class=\"skeleton-lines\"><i class=\"skeleton-line\" style=\"width:52%\"></i><i class=\"skeleton-line\" style=\"width:78%\"></i></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><div class=\"lesson-extras\"><section class=\"lesson-agent-prompt\" aria-labelledby=\"lesson-agent-title\"><h2 id=\"lesson-agent-title\">你可以这样告诉 AI Agent</h2><blockquote><span class=\"lesson-agent-quote\" aria-hidden=\"true\">“</span><p>文章列表等待数据时，请显示接近真实图片和标题布局的骨架，数据到达后原位替换；请求失败时改成错误和重试，不要一直保留骨架。请确认内容出现时页面没有明显跳动。</p></blockquote></section></div><div class=\"usage-grid\"><div class=\"usage-box use\"><h3><span class=\"mark\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m5 12.5 4.2 4.2L19 7\"></path></svg></span>什么时候用</h3><ul><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><b>首屏加载</b>：先给轮廓，内容陆续到位</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-scene\"><div class=\"mk-skel\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:36%;height:9px\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:92%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:85%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:60%\"></i></div></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><b>列表 / 信息流</b>：画几条假条目占位</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row\"><i style=\"width:16px;height:16px;border-radius:50%;background:#e5e6eb;flex:none\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:58%\"></i></div><div class=\"mk-row\"><i style=\"width:16px;height:16px;border-radius:50%;background:#e5e6eb;flex:none\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:44%\"></i></div></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><b>卡片 / 图片位</b>：大图未出先占好位置</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\"><i style=\"display:block;height:26px;border-radius:4px;background:#e5e6eb\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:70%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:45%\"></i></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><b>长文详情页</b>：段落形状防止布局跳动</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:100%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:96%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:88%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:45%\"></i></div></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"usage-box dont\"><h3><span class=\"mark\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7l10 10M17 7 7 17\"></path></svg></span>什么时候不用</h3><ul><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">只有几百毫秒的短加载：骨架可能闪现并干扰浏览</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-row \"><span class=\"mk-spinner\"></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">加载中，请稍候…</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">有明确进度：使用 <a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/progress?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"progress\" aria-label=\"进度条 Progress\">进度条 <b>Progress</b></a> 显示完成程度</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row between\"><span style=\"color:var(--text)\">📎 设计稿.sketch</span><span style=\"flex:1\"></span><span style=\"color:var(--text-3)\">66%</span></div><span class=\"mk-progress \" style=\"width:100%\"><i style=\"width:66%\"></i></span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">骨架与真实结构差异过大：内容出现时会引发明显跳动</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row\"><i style=\"width:16px;height:16px;border-radius:50%;background:#e5e6eb;flex:none\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:52%\"></i></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">真实内容是个表单，骨架和布局对不上</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">加载失败后仍持续显示骨架：使用 <a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/result?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"result\" aria-label=\"结果页 Result\">结果页 <b>Result</b></a> 说明结果和后续操作</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-scene\"><div class=\"mk-skel\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:80%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:88%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:64%\"></i></div><div style=\"position:absolute;bottom:6px;width:100%;text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">请求已失败，骨架屏却没有切换为错误状态</div></div></div></li></ul></div></div><section><div class=\"section-title\">组成结构 · Anatomy</div><div class=\"anat-wrap\"><div class=\"anat-stage\"><div class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"root\"><div class=\"skeleton-demo\"><div class=\"skeleton-row\"><div class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"avatar\"><i class=\"skeleton-avatar\"></i></div><div class=\"skeleton-lines\"><div class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"title\"><i class=\"skeleton-line\" style=\"width:45%\"></i></div><div class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"line\"><i class=\"skeleton-line\" style=\"width:88%\"></i></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"anat-parts\"><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"root\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">1</span><span class=\"pn\">骨架组</span><span class=\"pe\">Skeleton</span></button><span class=\"pd\">一组占位色块，形状对齐真实布局</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"avatar\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">2</span><span class=\"pn\">头像 / 图占位</span><span class=\"pe\">Avatar</span></button><span class=\"pd\">圆形或方块，对应媒体位</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"title\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">3</span><span class=\"pn\">标题占位</span><span class=\"pe\">Title</span></button><span class=\"pd\">短而粗的一行</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"line\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">4</span><span class=\"pn\">正文行占位</span><span class=\"pe\">Line</span></button><span class=\"pd\">长短错落的灰条，模仿段落</span></div></div></div></section><section><div class=\"section-title\">常见变体 · Variants</div><div class=\"variant-grid\"><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">列表项<span>List Item</span></div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><div class=\"skeleton-demo\"><div class=\"skeleton-row\"><i class=\"skeleton-avatar\"></i><div class=\"skeleton-lines\"><i class=\"skeleton-line\" style=\"width:55%\"></i><i class=\"skeleton-line\" style=\"width:80%\"></i></div></div></div></div><div class=\"variant-when\">信息流、消息列表加载时占位</div></div><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">文章段落<span>Paragraph</span></div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><div class=\"skeleton-demo\"><i class=\"skeleton-line\" style=\"width:38%;height:13px\"></i><i class=\"skeleton-line\" style=\"width:100%\"></i><i class=\"skeleton-line\" style=\"width:92%\"></i><i class=\"skeleton-line\" style=\"width:60%\"></i></div></div><div class=\"variant-when\">长文详情页加载，先摆出段落形状</div></div><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">卡片<span>Card</span></div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><div class=\"skeleton-demo\" style=\"width:150px\"><i class=\"skeleton-block\"></i><i class=\"skeleton-line\" style=\"width:70%\"></i><i class=\"skeleton-line\" style=\"width:45%\"></i></div></div><div class=\"variant-when\">图片、封面类卡片加载前占位</div></div></div></section><section class=\"scenes\"><div class=\"section-title\">典型使用场景</div><div class=\"scene-list\"><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">首页首屏加载</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-plain\"><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div class=\"skeleton-frame\" style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px\"><i class=\"skeleton-block\" style=\"width:52px;height:14px;border-radius:7px\"></i><i class=\"skeleton-line\" style=\"width:34px\"></i><i class=\"skeleton-line\" style=\"width:34px\"></i><i class=\"skeleton-line\" style=\"width:34px\"></i><i class=\"skeleton-avatar\" style=\"width:22px;height:22px;margin-left:auto\"></i></div>\n      <i class=\"skeleton-line\" style=\"width:44%;height:13px\"></i>\n      <i class=\"skeleton-line\" style=\"width:78%\"></i>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px\"><i class=\"skeleton-block\" style=\"width:64px;height:22px;border-radius:11px\"></i><i class=\"skeleton-block\" style=\"width:64px;height:22px;border-radius:11px\"></i></div>\n    </div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">列表加载占位</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-plain\"><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div class=\"skeleton-frame\" style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px\">\n      <div class=\"skeleton-row\"><i class=\"skeleton-avatar\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px\"></i><div class=\"skeleton-lines\"><i class=\"skeleton-line\" style=\"width:52%\"></i><i class=\"skeleton-line\" style=\"width:80%\"></i></div></div>\n      <div class=\"skeleton-row\"><i class=\"skeleton-avatar\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px\"></i><div class=\"skeleton-lines\"><i class=\"skeleton-line\" style=\"width:44%\"></i><i class=\"skeleton-line\" style=\"width:72%\"></i></div></div>\n      <div class=\"skeleton-row\"><i class=\"skeleton-avatar\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px\"></i><div class=\"skeleton-lines\"><i class=\"skeleton-line\" style=\"width:58%\"></i><i class=\"skeleton-line\" style=\"width:84%\"></i></div></div>\n    </div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">图片卡片占位</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-plain\"><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div class=\"skeleton-frame\" style=\"display:flex;gap:10px\">\n      <div style=\"flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:7px\"><i class=\"skeleton-block\" style=\"height:44px\"></i><i class=\"skeleton-line\" style=\"width:80%\"></i><i class=\"skeleton-line\" style=\"width:55%\"></i></div>\n      <div style=\"flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:7px\"><i class=\"skeleton-block\" style=\"height:44px\"></i><i class=\"skeleton-line\" style=\"width:70%\"></i><i class=\"skeleton-line\" style=\"width:48%\"></i></div>\n      <div style=\"flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:7px\"><i class=\"skeleton-block\" style=\"height:44px\"></i><i class=\"skeleton-line\" style=\"width:76%\"></i><i class=\"skeleton-line\" style=\"width:52%\"></i></div>\n    </div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">文章详情加载</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-plain\"><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div class=\"skeleton-frame\" style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:9px\">\n      <i class=\"skeleton-line\" style=\"width:38%;height:14px\"></i>\n      <i class=\"skeleton-line\" style=\"width:24%\"></i>\n      <i class=\"skeleton-line\" style=\"width:100%\"></i>\n      <i class=\"skeleton-line\" style=\"width:96%\"></i>\n      <i class=\"skeleton-line\" style=\"width:88%\"></i>\n      <i class=\"skeleton-line\" style=\"width:42%\"></i>\n    </div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"oil-ui-pro-recommendation\" aria-label=\"工具与支持\"><a class=\"oil-ui-pro-banner\" href=\"https://ui.oiloil.org/pro/\" target=\"_blank\" aria-label=\"了解 oil-ui-pro 完整版：让 AI 做 UI 设计的 Agent Skill\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"/vibe-hub/source/assets/services/oil-ui-pro-banner-zh.webp\" alt=\"oil-ui-pro：把 AI 的 UI 设计能力，推到极限。完整版多了交互、布局、配图、动效和反复评审。了解完整版。\" width=\"1600\" height=\"560\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></section></div>","sourceUrl":"https://vibe-hub.org/skeleton","markdown":"# 骨架屏Skeleton\n\n你可能会说\n加载时先显示灰色的框框占位，别一直转圈。\n\n**页面加载时先出现的灰色轮廓，用来占住稍后内容的位置**·例如打开商品列表时，可先看到图片框和两行文字的轮廓，真实内容到达后再替换。它只表示正在加载；等待过久或加载失败时，必须改成明确的提示和重试入口。\n\n## 你可以这样告诉 AI Agent\n\n> “\n> 文章列表等待数据时，请显示接近真实图片和标题布局的骨架，数据到达后原位替换；请求失败时改成错误和重试，不要一直保留骨架。请确认内容出现时页面没有明显跳动。\n\n### 什么时候用\n\n- **首屏加载**：先给轮廓，内容陆续到位\n- **列表 / 信息流**：画几条假条目占位\n- **卡片 / 图片位**：大图未出先占好位置\n- **长文详情页**：段落形状防止布局跳动\n\n### 什么时候不用\n\n- 只有几百毫秒的短加载：骨架可能闪现并干扰浏览\n\n加载中，请稍候…\n- 有明确进度：使用 [进度条 **Progress**](/vibe-hub/progress?lang=zh) 显示完成程度\n\n📎 设计稿.sketch66%\n- 骨架与真实结构差异过大：内容出现时会引发明显跳动\n\n真实内容是个表单，骨架和布局对不上\n- 加载失败后仍持续显示骨架：使用 [结果页 **Result**](/vibe-hub/result?lang=zh) 说明结果和后续操作\n\n请求已失败，骨架屏却没有切换为错误状态\n\n组成结构 · Anatomy\n\n1骨架组Skeleton一组占位色块，形状对齐真实布局\n\n2头像 / 图占位Avatar圆形或方块，对应媒体位\n\n3标题占位Title短而粗的一行\n\n4正文行占位Line长短错落的灰条，模仿段落\n\n常见变体 · Variants\n\n列表项List Item\n\n信息流、消息列表加载时占位\n\n文章段落Paragraph\n\n长文详情页加载，先摆出段落形状\n\n卡片Card\n\n图片、封面类卡片加载前占位\n\n典型使用场景\n\n首页首屏加载\n\n列表加载占位\n\n图片卡片占位\n\n文章详情加载"}